From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ai_re <ai_re@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:18:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/21] configs: alpine_v2_dmc12: network through al_eth

Legacy network stack with al_eth (00:01.0, "al_eth1"): dhcp, tftpboot,
ping, wget (HTTP, port from env httpdstp, server given as an IP). PCI is
enumerated at init so the port exists before the first network command.
No ethernet bootdev: "bootflow scan" stays disk-only as before (nothing
on the LAN can steer a default boot); network boots are explicit
commands. Env stays nowhere, no saveenv.

Scope: dmc12.
---
 configs/alpine_v2_dmc12_defconfig | 9 ++++++++-
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/alpine_v2_dmc12_defconfig b/configs/alpine_v2_dmc12_defconfig
index e4c537f8..8bac96d2 100644
--- a/configs/alpine_v2_dmc12_defconfig
+++ b/configs/alpine_v2_dmc12_defconfig
@@ -35,7 +35,13 @@ CONFIG_CMD_PART=y
 CONFIG_CMD_MEMINFO=y
 # CONFIG_MMC is not set
 CONFIG_ENV_IS_NOWHERE=y
-CONFIG_NO_NET=y
+CONFIG_NET_LEGACY=y
+CONFIG_AL_ETH=y
+CONFIG_CMD_DHCP=y
+CONFIG_CMD_TFTPBOOT=y
+CONFIG_CMD_PING=y
+CONFIG_CMD_WGET=y
+# CONFIG_BOOTDEV_ETH is not set
 CONFIG_AHCI=y
 CONFIG_AHCI_PCI=y
 CONFIG_SCSI_AHCI=y
@@ -48,6 +54,7 @@ CONFIG_I2C_MUX_PCA954x=y
 CONFIG_MISC=y
 CONFIG_I2C_EEPROM=y
 CONFIG_PCI=y
+CONFIG_PCI_INIT_R=y
 CONFIG_PCIE_ECAM_GENERIC=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_SHIFT=2
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_ANNOUNCE=y
-- 
